  "headline": "Delhi Police Apprehend Teen For Selling Stolen Agniveer Data Online",
  "seoTitle": "Delhi Police Arrest Teen For Agniveer Data Breach",
  "metaDescription": "Delhi authorities have taken a 14-year-old into custody following accusations of hacking a testing portal and attempting to sell Agniveer recruitment data.",
